[en.FOCUS_C08_TOGETHER_FOR_VICTORY]
Together for Victory

[en.FOCUS_C08_TOGETHER_FOR_VICTORY_desc]
“To Harmony!”\n“To Friendship!”\n“To Freedom!”\n“To Liberation!”\n\nFrom New Canterlot to Our Town, the United Resistance is allied under the same banner, together with all species and all creatures in the world who believe in Harmony, declaring war on the order of the Big Three!

[en.FOCUS_C08_TOGETHER_FOR_VICTORY_TOOLTIP]
§OTo Victory!§!

[zh.FOCUS_C08_TOGETHER_FOR_VICTORY]
联合制胜

[zh.FOCUS_C08_TOGETHER_FOR_VICTORY_desc]
“致谐律！”\n“致友谊！”\n“致自由！”\n“致解放！”\n\n从新坎特拉到平等镇，联合抵抗组织团结在同一面旗帜下，与世界上所有信奉谐律的所有物种，所有生灵一起，向三巨头的秩序宣战！\n\n“致胜利！”

[zh.FOCUS_C08_TOGETHER_FOR_VICTORY_TOOLTIP]
§O致胜利！§!

